save() and load() are the right things to do, and the files should be compatible across systems.

I suspect that something else went wrong, as the output on the server is a summary on a scantwo object, while the output on your computer is a summary of scantwo permutations.

Try doing it again. Try loading the file on the linux server to see what it contains.

karl

