The summary of scanone output provides the single largest LOD score on each chromosome.

If you want to infer multiple QTL, it's best to fit multiple-QTL models.
See the tutorial on multiple-QTL analysis, http://rqtl.org/tutorials/new_multiqtl.pdf
Or chapter 9 in the R/qtl book, http://rqtl.org/book

karl

